			(property "Description" "Zetta ZD25WQ16D 16 Mbit Standard/Dual/Quad SPI and QPI NOR flash, single 1.65-3.6 V supply (DS p4); SOP8 150 mil (T), -40 to 85 C (I) (DS p84); fC 85 MHz at 1.65-3.6 V, 133 MHz only at 3.0-3.6 V (DS p80 Table-18). Pins 3/7 are WP#/HOLD# at QE=0 (default) and IO2/IO3 at QE=1; tie them to a rail only with QE=0 (DS p10). WP#=0 locks the status register only at SRP1:0=01 (DS p10 Table-5). HOLD is disabled in Quad I/O and QPI mode (DS p8). QE is status bit S9: 31H writes S15-S8, a one-byte 01H writes S7-S0 only (DS p9, p24). Pin 7 has no RESET# function (DS p5 Table-1; SFDP p74 HW Reset# pin 0b)." (at 0 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
